  "title": "Crescent Closes $3.2 Billion Private Credit Continuation Vehicle",
  "summary": "Crescent Capital Group LP, one of the leading alternative credit investment firms, and Pantheon, one of the leading global private markets investors, today announced the closing of Crescent Credit Solutions VII CV (“CCS VII CV”), a $3.2 billion private credit continuation vehicle. CCS VII CV was established to acquire a diversified portfolio of performing sponsor-backed loans and securities and other equity interests from Crescent Mezzanine Partners VII, a 2016-vintage fund.",
